WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.890
Introducing Seeing AI.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.920
Seeing AI is an intelligent camera.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.279
It can provide you with information about
you and what is around you.

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:19.890
That’s perfectly useful for someone with
a vision impairment.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.260
Just hold up your phone and hear a description.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.240
Like when asking a friend, there will be different
things you want to know about.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.500
So switch between the channels, like you would
on a TV.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.750
And you’ll hear different types of information
being spoken out.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:39.160
You can read short pieces of text or scan
an entire document.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:44.350
You can recognize products, people and other
objects like currency.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.250
Let’s take a look at each channel in detail.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.070
Microsoft logo appears.

